title: The 1925 Presidential Election
subtitle: Germany's first direct Presidential Election, and hopefully not its last..
new-page: true
view-if: year = 1925 and month >= 4 and ebert_dead == 1
tags: event
on-arrival: left_campaign = 0; center_campaign = 0; labor_campaign = 0; reformist_campaign = 0; neorevisionist_campaign = 0; nonfactional_campaign = 0; dvp_campaign = 1; z_campaign = 1; held_campaign = 1; liebknecht_campaign = 1; ludendorff_campaign = 1; hellpach_campaign = 1; 

It is expected that a wide variety of candidates will enter the race, though there has also been much discussion about joint candidates. Some in our Reformist wing argue that we should run a joint Weimar candidate. One suggestion which has been floated is Otto Gessler, to be backed by the SPD, DDP, Center Party, and DVP, but, with our party's left-wing is decisively opposed and the DVP reluctant, this has gone nowhere.
There are also those on our party's left who argue we should run a joint Socialist candidate with the [+ uspd_name +], though many others dismiss the idea as a pipedream.

As the incumbent Presidential party, many within the SPD and without expect us to run a candidate. Paul Löbe, the newly elected President of the Reichstag, is a popular option, as is Otto Braun, Minister-President of Prussia.

Which path should we take?

- @presidential_candidate_braun
- @presidential_candidate_lobe_25
- @presidential_candidate_left_incumbent
- @presidential_candidate_left_previous
- @presidential_candidate_left_chancellor
- @presidential_candidate_center_incumbent
- @presidential_candidate_center_previous
- @presidential_candidate_center_chancellor
- @presidential_candidate_labor_incumbent
- @presidential_candidate_labor_previous
- @presidential_candidate_labor_chancellor
- @presidential_candidate_reformist_incumbent
- @presidential_candidate_reformist_previous
- @presidential_candidate_reformist_chancellor
- @presidential_candidate_neorevisionist_incumbent
- @presidential_candidate_neorevisionist_previous
- @presidential_candidate_neorevisionist_chancellor
- @back_gessler_no: Back Otto Gessler of the DDP as a joint Republican candidate.
- @back_liebknecht_no: Back Karl Liebknecht of the [+ uspd_name +]
- @spd_presidential_menu: Perhaps we should consider a different candidate?

@spd_presidential_campaign
title: We choose [+ spd_presidential_candidate +] 
subtitle: The Campaign begins.
on-arrival: spd_campaign = 1

We have entered [+ spd_presidential_candidate +] into the race. Now it is time to campaign - without a healthy campaign, they may not even be assured the votes of the SPD.

- @the_other_candidates_marx_jarres: Let us look at the candidates we face.
- @the_other_candidates_marx_stresemann: Let us look at the candidates we face.
- @the_other_candidates_wirth_jarres: Let us look at the candidates we face.

@the_other_candidates_marx_jarres
view-if: chancellor != "Marx" and chancellor != "Jarres" 
on-arrival: z_presidential_candidate = "Marx"; z_presidential_candidate_fullname = "Wilhelm Marx"; dvp_presidential_candidate = "Jarres"; dvp_presidential_candidate_fullname = "Karl Jarres";

@the_other_candidates_marx_stresemann
view-if: chancellor != "Marx" and chancellor == "Jarres" 
on-arrival: z_presidential_candidate = "Marx"; z_presidential_candidate_fullname = "Wilhelm Marx"; dvp_presidential_candidate = "Stresemann"; dvp_presidential_candidate_fullname = "Gustav Stresemann"

@the_other_candidates_wirth_jarres
view-if: chancellor == "Marx" and chancellor != "Jarres" 
on-arrival: z_presidential_candidate = "Wirth"; z_presidential_candidate_fullname = "Joseph Wirth"; dvp_presidential_candidate = "Jarres"; dvp_presidential_candidate_fullname = "Karl Jarres";

The [+ uspd_name +] has entered into the race their leader Karl Liebknecht, while the DVP and DNVP run [+ dvp_presidential_candidate_fullname +] as the "Reichsblock" candidate. The Center Party has run [+ z_presidential_candidate_fullname +], while the BVP, unwilling to commit to any of the main candidates, has run Heinrich Held. The DDP is running Willy Hellpach and meanwhile, the recently reformed National Socialists are backing Ludendorff.

- @campaign_spd: Now, we must campaign.

@campaign_spd
on-arrival: spd_percent = 0.7

- @large_campaign: We will launch a large-scale campaign for [+ spd_presidential_candidate +].
- @small_campaign: We will launch a small-scale campaign for [+ spd_presidential_candidate +].
- @round1: Let the voting begin...

@large_campaign
subtitle: -2 resources
choose-if: resources >= 2
on-arrival: resources -= 2; spd_percent += 0.3;
go-to: campaign_spd
max-visits: 1

We launch a large-scale campaign for [+ spd_presidential_candidate +] to ensure turnout from our party members.

@small_campaign
subtitle: -1 resource
on-arrival: resources -= 1; spd_percent += 0.15
choose-if: resources >= 1
go-to: campaign_spd
max-visits: 1

We launch a small-scale campaign for [+ spd_presidential_candidate +] to try and ensure turnout from our party members.

@back_liebknecht_no
choose-if: never
unavailable-subtitle: As the larger Socialist Party, we are unwilling to stand aside.

@back_gessler_no
choose-if: never
unavailable-subtitle: Our Left will not tolerate this course of action. The DVP is uncomfortably noncommittal.

@round1
on-arrival: round25 += 1
go-to: election_algorithm
set-jump: post_election

@post_election
on-arrival: {!
Q.liebknecht_votes = 0;
Q.spd_votes = 0;
Q.hellpach_votes = 0;
Q.z_votes = 0;
Q.held_votes = 0;
Q.dvp_votes = 0;
Q.ludendorff_votes = 0;
Q.gessler_votes = 0;
Q.hergt_votes = 0;
Q.hindenburg_votes = 0;
Q.majority_25 = 0;

Q.presidents_25 = ['liebknecht', 'spd', 'hellpach', 'z', 'held', 'dvp', 'ludendorff', 'gessler', 'hergt', 'hindenburg'];

// initial phase:
if (Q.spd_campaign) {
    if (Q.z_support_spd) {
        var z_percent = (0.55+(Q.z_relation/100))/2;
        Q.spd_votes += Q.z_normalized*z_percent;
        if (Q.spd_percent < 1) {
            Q.spd_percent += 0.1;
            Q.spd_percent = Math.min(Q.spd_percent, 1);
        }
    }
    if (Q.ddp_support_spd) {
        var ddp_percent = (0.6+(Q.ddp_relation/100))/2;
        Q.spd_votes += Q.ddp_normalized*ddp_percent;
        if (Q.spd_percent < 1) {
            Q.spd_percent += 0.05;
            Q.spd_percent = Math.min(Q.spd_percent, 1);
        }
    }
    if (Q.uspd_support_spd) {
        var uspd_percent = (0.6+(Q.uspd_relation/100))/2;
        Q.spd_votes += Q.uspd_normalized*uspd_percent;
        if (Q.spd_percent < 1) {
            Q.spd_percent += 0.05;
            Q.spd_percent = Math.min(Q.spd_percent, 1);
        }
    }
    Q.spd_votes += Q.spd_normalized*Q.spd_percent;
    Q.spd_votes += Q.socialism/2750;
    Q.spd_votes += Q.pro_republic/2000;
    if (Q.ddp_support_spd && Q.z_support_spd) {
        Q.spd_votes += Q.pro_republic/3000;
    }
    Q.spd_votes += ((Math.floor(Math.random() * 11))/500);
}
if (Q.liebknecht_campaign) {
    Q.liebknecht_votes += Q.uspd_normalized*0.9;
    Q.liebknecht_votes += ((Math.floor(Math.random() * 11))/500);
    Q.liebknecht_votes += Q.socialism/4000;
    if (Q.gessler_campaign) {
        var left_dissent_percent = (Q.left_strength*(1+(Q.left_dissent/100)))/100;
        Q.liebknecht_votes += Q.spd_normalized*(left_dissent_percent/2);
    }
    if (Q.round25 > 1) {
        Q.liebknecht_votes = Q.liebknecht_votes*0.85;
        Q.liebknecht_votes += Q.spd_normalized*0.25;
    }
}
if (Q.hellpach_campaign) {
    Q.hellpach_votes += Q.ddp_normalized;
    Q.hellpach_votes += ((Math.floor(Math.random() * 11))/500);
    Q.hellpach_votes += Q.pro_republic/4500;
}
if (Q.held_campaign) {
    Q.held_votes += 0.03;
    Q.held_votes += Q.nationalism/4500;
}
if (Q.z_campaign) {
    Q.z_votes += Q.z_normalized;
    if (!Q.bvp_support_z) {
        Q.z_votes -= 0.03;
    }
    Q.z_votes += ((Math.floor(Math.random() * 11))/500);
    Q.z_votes += Q.pro_republic/2750;
    if (Q.spd_support_z) {
        var left_dissent_percent = (Q.left_strength*(1+(Q.left_dissent/100)))/100;
        Q.z_votes += (Q.spd_normalized*0.75*(1-(left_dissent_percent*(Q.pro_republic/100))))*Q.spd_percent;
        Q.z_votes += Q.pro_republic/4500;
    }
    if (Q.ddp_support_z) {
        Q.z_votes += Q.ddp_normalized;
    }
    if (Q.debug_z_bonus) {
        Q.z_votes += Q.debug_z_bonus;
    }
}
if (Q.dvp_campaign) {
    Q.dvp_votes += Q.dvp_normalized;
    Q.dvp_votes += Q.dnvp_normalized;
    Q.dvp_votes += Q.other_normalized;
    Q.dvp_votes += ((Math.floor(Math.random() * 11))/500);
    Q.dvp_votes += Q.nationalism/1500;
    Q.dvp_votes += Q.nsdap_normalized/4;
}
if (Q.ludendorff_campaign) {
    Q.ludendorff_votes += Q.nsdap_normalized/8;
    Q.ludendorff_votes += ((Math.floor(Math.random() * 11))/500);
}
if (Q.gessler_campaign) {
    var spd_turnout = 0.7;
    if (Q.round25 > 1) {
        spd_turnout += 0.1;
    }
    var left_dissent_percent = (Q.left_strength*(1+(Q.left_dissent/100)))/100;
    Q.gessler_votes += ((Q.spd_normalized*(1-left_dissent_percent))*(1-Q.dissent))*spd_turnout;
    Q.gessler_votes += Q.z_normalized-0.03;
    if (Q.bvp_support_gessler) {
        Q.gessler_votes += 0.03;
    }
    Q.gessler_votes += Q.ddp_normalized;
    if (!Q.dvp_abstain) {
        Q.gessler_votes += Q.dvp_normalized*(Q.pro_republic/100);
    }
    Q.gessler_votes += Q.pro_republic/3500;
    if (!Q.hindenburg_campaign) {
        Q.gessler_votes += Q.other_normalized*(Q.pro_republic/200);
    }
    Q.gessler_votes += ((Math.floor(Math.random() * 11))/500);
}
if (Q.hergt25_campaign) {
    Q.hergt_votes += Q.dnvp_normalized;
    Q.hergt_votes += Q.dvp_normalized*(Q.nationalism/150);
    Q.hergt_votes += Q.other_normalized*(Q.nationalism/100);
    Q.hergt_votes += ((Math.floor(Math.random() * 11))/500);
}
if (Q.hindenburg_campaign) {
    Q.hindenburg_votes += Q.dnvp_normalized;
    Q.hindenburg_votes += Q.other_normalized;
    Q.hindenburg_votes += Q.nsdap_normalized;
    Q.hindenburg_votes += ((Math.floor(Math.random() * 11))/500);
    Q.hindenburg_votes += Q.nationalism/1000;
    Q.hindenburg_votes += (100-Q.pro_republic)/1000;
    if (Q.dvp_support_hindenburg) {
        Q.hindenburg_votes += Q.dvp_normalized;
    }
    if (Q.bvp_support_hindenburg) {
        Q.hindenburg_votes += 0.03;
    }
}

var total_votes = 0;
var highest_support = 0;
for (var k of Q.presidents_25) {
    total_votes += Q[k+'_votes'];
}
for (var k of Q.presidents_25) {
    Q[k+'_votes'] = ((Q[k+'_votes']/total_votes)*1000)/10;
    if (Q[k+'_votes'] >= highest_support) {
        highest_support = Q[k+'_votes'];
        Q[k+'_plurality'] = 1;
    } else {
        Q[k+'_plurality'] = 0;
    }
    if (Q[k+'_votes'] >= 50) {
        Q[k+'_majority'] = 1;
        Q.majority_25 = 1;
    }
    Q[k+'_votes_disp'] = Q[k+'_votes'].toFixed(1);
}
for (var k of Q.presidents_25) {
    if (Q[k+'_plurality']) {
        if (Q[k+'_votes'] < highest_support) {
           Q[k+'_plurality'] = 0;
        }
    }
}
!}

go-to: hindenburg_wins if hindenburg_majority == 1; z_wins if z_majority == 1; spd_wins if spd_majority == 1; gessler_wins if gessler_majority == 1; no_majority_round1 if majority_25 == 0 and round25 == 1; round2_results if round25 >= 2

Results:

